# Multimodal RAG Ingestion Pipeline

Production-grade document ingestion pipeline for technical manuals, service manuals, SOPs, and engineering documentation.

Current Progress:

✅ Phase 1 — Domain Models  
✅ Phase 2 — Docling Parser  
✅ Phase 3 — Hierarchy Builder  
✅ Phase 4 — Figure Extraction  
✅ Phase 5 — Figure Association  
✅ Phase 5.5 — Page Boundary Resolution  
✅ Phase 6 — Procedure Chunk Generation  
✅ Phase 6.5 — Procedure Detection  
✅ Phase 7 — Chunk Enrichment  
✅ Phase 8 — Image Context Builder  

❌ Embeddings  
❌ Vector Database  
❌ Retrieval Layer  
❌ LLM Layer  

---

# Supported Documents

- Service Manuals
- User Guides
- SOPs
- Technical Documentation
- Maintenance Manuals

---

# Project Structure

```text
project/
│
├── assets/
│
├── data/
│   └── raw/
│
├── src/
│   │
│   ├── domain/
│   ├── exceptions/
│   ├── parsers/
│   ├── processors/
│   │   ├── hierarchy/
│   │   ├── figures/
│   │   ├── association/
│   │   ├── page_resolution/
│   │   ├── procedures/
│   │   ├── chunking/
│   │   ├── enrichment/
│   │   └── image_context/
│   │
│   ├── pipelines/
│   └── utils/
│
├── pyproject.toml
└── README.md
```

---

# Python Version

```bash
Python 3.11+
```

Verify:

```bash
python --version
```

---

# Create Virtual Environment

Linux / macOS

```bash
python -m venv .venv
source .venv/bin/activate
```

Windows

```powershell
python -m venv .venv
.venv\Scripts\activate
```

---

# Install Dependencies

```bash
pip install -U pip
```

Install core dependencies:

```bash
pip install \
docling \
pydantic \
loguru \
orjson
```

Or:

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
```

---

# requirements.txt

```text
docling>=2.40.0
pydantic>=2.10.0
loguru>=0.7.3
orjson>=3.10.15
```

---

# Add Documents

Create:

```text
data/
└── raw/
```

Place PDFs:

```text
data/raw/
├── MX-B468P-Service-Manual.pdf
├── Manual2.pdf
└── Manual3.pdf
```

---

# Verify Parser

Run:

```bash
python -m src.pipelines.parse_document
```

Expected:

```text
INFO Parsing MX-B468P-Service-Manual.pdf
```

Parser should return:

```text
Document
```

with:

```text
raw_markdown
page_markdown
total_pages
```

---

# Verify Hierarchy

Run:

```bash
python -m src.pipelines.build_hierarchy
```

Expected:

```text
- Diagnostics and troubleshooting
  - Troubleshooting overview
  - Fixing print quality issues
```

---

# Verify Page Resolution

Run:

```bash
python -m src.pipelines.resolve_pages
```

Expected:

```text
Diagnostics and troubleshooting [29-122]
Fixing print quality issues [36-55]
Gray background or toner fog [37-38]
```

---

# Verify Figure Extraction

Run:

```bash
python -m src.pipelines.extract_figures
```

Expected:

```text
Extracted X figures
```

Images should appear:

```text
assets/
└── <document_id>/
    └── images/
```

---

# Verify Figure Association

Run:

```bash
python -m src.pipelines.associate_figures
```

Expected:

```text
figure_id
heading_path
```

Example:

```text
fig_123
[
 "Diagnostics and troubleshooting",
 "Fixing print quality issues",
 "Gray background or toner fog"
]
```

---

# Verify Procedure Detection

Run:

```bash
python -m src.pipelines.detect_procedures
```

Expected:

```text
Detected 120 procedures
```

Example:

```text
Gray background or toner fog
Blank pages
Print is too dark
200 paper jams
```

---

# Verify Chunk Generation

Run:

```bash
python -m src.pipelines.generate_chunks
```

Expected:

```text
Generated X chunks
```

Example:

```text
Gray background or toner fog
37
38
3
```

Meaning:

```text
Title
Page Start
Page End
Image Count
```

---

# Verify Chunk Enrichment

Run:

```bash
python -m src.pipelines.enrich_chunks
```

Expected:

```python
{
    "hierarchy_context": "...",
    "chunk_depth": 3,
    "image_count": 2,
    "word_count": 850
}
```

---

# Verify Image Context

Run:

```bash
python -m src.pipelines.build_image_context
```

Expected:

```text
Hierarchy:
Diagnostics and troubleshooting >
Fixing print quality issues >
Gray background or toner fog

Procedure:
Gray background or toner fog

Procedure Content:
...
```

---

# Recommended Validation Sequence

Run in this order:

```bash
python -m src.pipelines.parse_document

python -m src.pipelines.build_hierarchy

python -m src.pipelines.resolve_pages

python -m src.pipelines.extract_figures

python -m src.pipelines.associate_figures

python -m src.pipelines.detect_procedures

python -m src.pipelines.generate_chunks

python -m src.pipelines.enrich_chunks

python -m src.pipelines.build_image_context
```

---

# Current Output Artifacts

After Phase 8:

```text
Document
│
├── Sections
│
├── Figures
│   └── context_text
│
└── Chunks
    ├── heading_path
    ├── page range
    ├── image references
    └── enrichment metadata
```

This is the recommended checkpoint for manual inspection before proceeding to:

```text
Phase 9  Validation Layer
Phase 10 Storage Layer
Phase 11 Incremental Ingestion
Phase 12 Pipeline Orchestration
```